{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34360","headline":"奉和袭美开元寺客省早景即事次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美开元寺客省早景即事次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日上罘罳叠影红，一声清梵万缘空。\n䙰褷满地贝多雪，料峭入楼于阗风。\n水榭初抽寥泬思，竹窗犹挂梦魂中。\n灵香散尽禅家接，谁共殷源小品同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}